        <mxCell id="bottom_card" value="FITUR TRANSVERSAL: MONITORING REAL-TIME, AUDIT LOG &amp; HAK AKSES SISTEM" style="shape=rect;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#1E293B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="50" y="1110" width="2130" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="card_mon1" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Dashboard &amp; Warning SLA&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;• SLA = 1 bulan kalender dari SPDP&#xa;• Batas tahun kalender mutlak menang&#xa;• Indikator visual kartu SLA Warning&#xa;• Widget Berkas DPO &amp; Trend Bulanan" style="shape=rect;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1E293B;strokeColor=#334155;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#E2E8F0;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="1145" width="480" height="95" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="card_mon2" value="&lt;b&gt;2. Pencarian Cerdas &amp; Quick-View&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;• Live filter AJAX tanpa reload halaman&#xa;• Kolom pencarian mencakup: No Berkas, Tersangka, No Sprindik, No SPDP, &amp; Status&#xa;• Quick-View Modal: detail berkas, riwayat tahapan, &amp; dokumen PDF terlampir" style="shape=rect;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1E293B;strokeColor=#334155;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#E2E8F0;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="590" y="1145" width="500" height="95" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="card_mon3" value="&lt;b&gt;3. Audit Trail Terpusat (Audit Log)&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;• Pencatatan otomatis setiap aksi penting&#xa;• Finalisasi tahap, draft, upload dokumen, aktivasi/deaktivasi DPO dicatat detail&#xa;• Menyimpan User, IP, Timestamp, Data Lama &amp; Data Baru (Immutable / Tidak Bisa Diedit)" style="shape=rect;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1E293B;strokeColor=#334155;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#E2E8F0;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1120" y="1145" width="510" height="95" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="card_mon4" value="&lt;b&gt;4. Keamanan &amp; Integritas Data&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;• &lt;b&gt;TIDAK ADA HARD DELETE&lt;/b&gt; (Semua Soft Delete)&#xa;• &lt;b&gt;PENGUNCIAN TAHAP PERMANEN&lt;/b&gt;: Administrator pun TIDAK DAPAT mengedit/memundurkan tahap final&#xa;• RBAC: Penyidik (Input/Draft), Pimpinan (Read-Only), Admin (User &amp; Master)" style="shape=rect;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1E293B;strokeColor=#334155;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#E2E8F0;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1660" y="1145" width="490" height="95" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>


        <!-- ========================================== -->
        <!-- EDGES / CONNECTOR FLOWS -->
        <!-- ========================================== -->

        <!-- Start to Input LK -->
